pass in proto tcp from any to any user root flags S/SA
pass out proto udp from any to any group wheel
pass in inet proto icmp all icmp-type echoreq code 0
pass in inet6 proto icmp6 all icmp6-type { unreach, timex }
pass in all tos lowdelay
pass in all set tos 0x10
pass out all keep state (max 100, no-sync, sloppy, source-track rule, max-src-nodes 10, max-src-states 10, max-src-conn 10, max-src-conn-rate 10/30, overload <bad> flush global, if-bound)
match in all scrub (no-df, min-ttl 5, max-mss 1400, reassemble tcp, random-id)
pass in all fragment
pass in all allow-opts
pass in all once
pass in proto udp from any to any divert-packet port 8500
pass in proto tcp from any to any divert-reply
pass in proto tcp from any to any divert-to 127.0.0.1 port 8080
pass in all label "test label"
pass in all tag mytag
pass in all tagged mytag
pass in all !tagged mytag
pass out all max-pkt-rate 10/5
pass out all set delay 10
pass out all set prio 3
pass out all set prio (3, 5)
pass out all set queue std
pass out all set queue (std, pri)
pass out all rtable 5
pass out all probability 50%
pass out all prio 3
pass out proto tcp from any to any af-to inet from 10.0.0.1 to 10.0.0.2
pass out proto tcp from any to any binat-to 10.0.0.1/24 port 80 round-robin sticky-address
pass out proto tcp from any to any rdr-to 10.0.0.1 port 8080 bitmask
pass out proto tcp from any to any nat-to 10.0.0.1 port 1024:65535 random static-port
pass out proto tcp from any to any route-to 10.0.0.1
pass out proto tcp from any to any reply-to 10.0.0.1
pass out proto tcp from any to any dup-to 10.0.0.1
pass out all received-on em0
pass out all !received-on em0
